 "notes": "Glenway Avenue: the E-W street at y~1640 is labelled only AVENUE on this plate; taken as Glenway from INSTRUCTIONS22 and its 3400-3600 house numbers. Mayfield Avenue: the E-W piece east of Ross (y~670) and its N-S leg x~7342 to Glenway are labelled only AVENUE; MAYFIELD is printed in line with it west of Ross. Carson Avenue: south of Glenway the street (x~7325) runs south then SW, crossing Laclede, and is labelled CARSON further SW; recorded at the Glenway crossing under both Mayfield and Carson. Wells Street: labelled STREET north of Glenway and WELLS south; it jogs at Warsaw (north leg x~8369, south leg x~8460, both recorded as T). North of Glenway it continues NNE as a road to Lehman Road and NE to the plate top (name not printed there). Fairbanks Avenue also jogs at Warsaw (north x~8948, south x~8867). '?' = E-W street labelled only ST. (y~2258) from the NE end of Lasalle to McPherson. Laclede Avenue: the E-W 'AVENUE' at y~2712 taken as the continuation of LACLEDE. Ross Avenue: diagonal labelled only AVENUE, taken as continuation of ROSS printed SW of Glenway. Ross x Mayfield (~6560,675) and Kuhlman x Glenway lie beyond 300 px west and are not recorded. Large spaced lettering (Glen Grove, G.F. Meyer's, J.E. Bell's Glenn Grove, Kurms, etc.) treated as subdivision names. | Glenway Avenue (y~1640) printed only AVENUE in the strip; GLENWAY is printed on the same road at x~1300. West Liberty is cut by the plate's top edge; its centre taken mid visible street (y~176). '?' at (6714,176): diagonal street from West Liberty SW to Mayfield, printed only AVENUE. '?' at y~1216: unnamed 40 ft street between Wessels Avenue and Carson Avenue. Carson Avenue: CARSON printed on the diagonal; the north-south street from Mayfield to Glenway is printed only AVENUE and is taken as Carson's continuation (aligned across Glenway); suffix Avenue from that label. Wessels Avenue: printed 'AVE.' at the north end and 'WESSELS' at the south. Wells Street: WELLS ST. printed south of Glenway; north of Glenway the same street is printed only STREET (aligned), then runs NNE and NE to West Liberty; Lehman Road (60 ft) T's into it. Wells jogs about 90 px at Warsaw (8370 north, 8462 south), so two T's recorded. Fairbanks Avenue likewise jogs at Warsaw (8870 south, 8950 north). '?' at y~3495: avenue running west-south-west from the Warsaw junction, printed only AVENUE (name not found). Laclede Avenue: LACLEDE printed on the ESE segment, AVENUE on the east-west segment to McPherson. Lasalle Street: LASALLE on the diagonal, ST. on the east-west part. Glenway, Warsaw and West 8th have a solid line (street-car track) inside; not a street edge. Gray/green bands at y~1940, 2690, 4660 are boundaries, not streets. Large spaced letters (Glen Grove, G.F. Meyer's, Boyle's, John Drott, Kurm, J.E. Bell's, C. Young's Est.) are subdivision names. Crossings with centres west of 6640 (e.g. diagonal x Mayfield ~6490,665; Carson x Warsaw ~6560,2980) were not picked."
